#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:108
msgid "1) Certificates must be prepared for all environments (self-signed allowed) following the requirements in Certificate Governance - Authentication: TNPTLS - Upload: TNPUP - SCA(s): TNPSCA"
msgstr "1) Deben prepararse certificados para todos los entornos (se admiten certificados autofirmados) conforme a los requisitos de Gobernanza de certificados - Autenticación: TNPTLS - Carga: TNPUP - SCA(s): TNPSCA"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:291
msgid "1) check the connectivity with the following command:   input:"
msgstr "1) compruebe la conectividad con el siguiente comando:   input:"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:119
msgid "2) Prepare public keys in PEM format in your private GitHub repository (see [11]) dedicated to the used environment keys."
msgstr "2) Prepare las claves públicas en formato PEM en su repositorio privado de GitHub (véase [11]) dedicado a las claves del entorno utilizado."

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:326
msgid "2) Test the other Trustlist Routes in the same style (e. g. with DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…)"
msgstr "2) Pruebe las demás rutas de la lista de confianza del mismo modo (p. ej., con DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…)"

