msgid "3-digit ISO Participant code"
msgstr "Código ISO de 3 dígitos del Participante"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:196
msgid "3-digit ISO participant code of the TNP"
msgstr "Código ISO de 3 dígitos del participante TNP"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:121
msgid "3) The prepared public keys must be tagged by the generated GPG keys:"
msgstr "3) Las claves públicas preparadas deben etiquetarse con las claves GPG generadas:"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:355
msgid "a) Create a Document Signer Certificate (DSC) and sign it by the SCA"
msgstr "a) Cree un certificado del firmante de documentos (DSC) y fírmelo con el SCA"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:338
msgid "a) Upload one or more DSCs to the TNG"
msgstr "a) Cargue uno o más DSC en la TNG"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:27
